  "description": "<i>The Quintessential Quintuplets: Spring, Summer, Autumn, Winter</i> adapts the official sequel novel penned by Hajime Asano—a work that depicts \"the continuation of the original story\"—under the complete supervision of the original manga author, Negi Haruba.<br><br>\nSpanning the period from January of their third year of high school through December following their graduation, this series portrays a fresh year in the daily lives of the quintuplets.<br><br>\n(Source: Official Website, translated)<br><br>\n<i>Note: Title and relations are provisional and subject to change.</i>",
